            "review_title": "Review at Pizza 4P's Thiso Mall",
            "review_text": "sannamoo\nFairfax, Virginia4810 contributions\n0\nExcellent food, service, and ambiance.\nMay 2026 • Friends\nPizza 4P's offers exceptional Italian cuisine and is renowned for producing its own fresh mozzarella, burrata, camembert, and ricotta. These ingredients are frequently featured in its popular dishes, including hand-tossed, wood-fired pizzas with fresh, unique toppings, all served in a modern, welcoming environment.\n\nThis outlet is located on the ground floor of a bustling shopping mall and is regarded as one of the premier pizza establishments in Ho Chi Minh City. The venue is highly popular, and reservations are strongly recommended. The service provided was excellent and cordial, and complimentary drinking water was available, which was greatly appreciated.\n\n- We selected Burrata with mixed tropical fruits, resulting in a refreshing salad where the sweetness of the fruits balances beautifully with Burrata's mild, fresh, creamy, buttery flavor.\n\n- The half-and-half pizza with soy garlic beef, Camembert, ham, and mushroom sauce was enjoyable and not too heavy. Its thin pizza dough was pleasant to eat.\n\n- Kombucha was an excellent match with the food we had.\nRead more\nWritten May 8, 2026\nPizza 4P's Guest Service\nDear Mr./Ms. Sannamoo,\n\nThank you very much for taking the time to share such a detailed and thoughtful review about your experience at Pizza 4P’s Thiso Mall.\nWe are truly delighted to know that you enjoyed not only the dishes but also the overall dining atmosphere and service during your visit. It is wonderful to hear your compliments about our homemade cheeses, especially the burrata, as well as the hand-tossed pizzas and kombucha pairing. Your detailed descriptions of the flavors and combinations are sincerely appreciated by our team.\n\nWe are also very happy to know that the service and hospitality provided by our staff left a positive impression on you. Your kind words are a great encouragement for us to continue delivering memorable dining experiences to every guest.\n\nThank you once again for your thoughtful review and continued support. We truly look forward to welcoming you back to Pizza 4P’s back soon. 🤗💙\nBest regards,\nPizza 4P’s Team\nRead more\nWritten May 9, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
